   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We are taking all of those core structures:\n",
    "\n",
    "- fire_data: neural activity matrix, z-scored, using 500 ms time bins\n",
    "\n",
    "- cer_data: behavioral suppression matrix (fear-related measure)\n",
    "\n",
    "- poke_data: poke-related measure (e.g., nose poke timing/cessation)\n",
    "\n",
    "and putting them into one frame for our correlations. This will also make feature selection easier as we will have access to all the neurons to keep or drop when tweaking with the models later."
   ]
  },
